<navigation-bar title="日期提醒" color="#292824" background="#F7F4ED"></navigation-bar>
<scroll-view class="page-scroll" scroll-y type="list"><view class="page-pad reminder-page">
  <view class="title-row">
    <view class="title-main"><view class="page-title">日期提醒</view><view class="muted count">循环 · 提前提醒</view></view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{cloudHint}}" class="cloud-hint card">
    <text class="cloud-hint-title">云端同步未生效</text>
    <text class="cloud-hint-body">{{cloudHint}}</text>
    <text class="cloud-hint-foot">提醒数据目前只保存在本机，修好后重新保存一次即可同步。</text>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{todayCount}}" class="banner card">
    <text class="banner-icon">🔔</text>
    <view class="banner-body"><view class="banner-title">今天有 {{todayCount}} 条提醒</view><view class="banner-sub">{{bannerSub}}</view></view>
  </view>

  <view class="push card">
    <view class="push-body">
      <view class="push-title">微信推送</view>
      <view class="push-sub">{{pushHint}}</view>
    </view>
    <button class="ghost-btn push-btn" bindtap="enablePush">{{pushAuto === 'reject' || pushAuto === 'off' ? '去设置' : '额度+1'}}</button>
  </view>

  <view class="push-guide card">
    <view class="guide-title">推送怎么才能真正收到</view>
    <view class="guide-item"><text class="guide-index">1</text><text class="guide-text">第一次点「额度+1」时，在弹窗底部勾上「总是保持以上选择，不再询问」，之后就不会再弹窗打扰你。</text></view>
    <view class="guide-item"><text class="guide-index">2</text><text class="guide-text">勾上之后额度会自动补：首页抽签、记录一餐、签到这些点击里，只要额度低于 60 次就静默续上一条。</text></view>
    <view class="guide-item"><text class="guide-index">3</text><text class="guide-text">攒到 60 次就停手，不再自动加；想要更多就点「额度+1」，那个按钮任何时候都管用。</text></view>
    <view class="guide-item"><text class="guide-index">4</text><text class="guide-text">只要额度大于 0，提醒到点就会自动推送，推一条扣一次；额度用完才会停。</text></view>
    <view class="guide-item"><text class="guide-index">5</text><text class="guide-text">攒下的额度永久有效、不会过期；推送会出现在微信的「服务通知」里。</text></view>
  </view>

  <view wx:for="{{groups}}" wx:for-item="group" wx:key="key" class="group">
    <view class="group-head"><text class="section-title">{{group.title}}</text><text wx:if="{{group.hint}}" class="group-hint">{{group.hint}}</text><text class="group-count">{{group.items.length}} 条</text></view>
    <view class="card list-card">
      <view wx:for="{{group.items}}" wx:for-item="item" wx:key="id" class="item {{item.enabled ? '' : 'off'}} {{item.active ? '' : 'muted'}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="editReminder" bindlongpress="removeReminder">
        <view class="item-main">
          <view class="item-title">{{item.content}}</view>
          <view class="item-tags">
            <text wx:if="{{item.lunarTag}}" class="tag">{{item.lunarTag}}</text>
            <text class="tag">{{item.repeatText}}</text>
            <text class="tag">{{item.timeText}}</text>
          </view>
          <view class="item-sub">{{item.eventLabel ? item.eventLabel + ' · ' : ''}}{{item.advanceText}}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="item-side">
          <view class="trigger {{item.today ? 'hot' : ''}}">{{item.statusText}}</view>
          <view class="switch-wrap" catchtap="noop">
            <switch class="mini-switch" checked="{{item.enabled}}" color="#E85D3F" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindchange="toggleReminder" />
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{!total}}" class="empty card">还没有提醒<br/><text>去「我的」页点「新建提醒」或「新建纪念日」</text></view>
  <view wx:else class="tip-line">轻点编辑 · 长按删除</view>
</view></scroll-view>
